[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: CareerOps Migration Requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MIG-001
TITLE: Preserve existing tracker records and history
STATEMENT: Each legacy tracker record shall be traceable by its original ID to its migrated tracking record. The migration shall preserve its recorded statuses, dates, notes, and existing workflow history.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-NORM-001
TITLE: Maintain CareerOps records independently
STATEMENT: CareerOps shall maintain company, recruiter, position, and contributor records independently. Multiple positions shall be able to reference the same company and recruiter. Updating shared company details shall preserve each pursuit's status and workflow history. A contributor shall be able to exist without a position assignment.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-WF-001
TITLE: View pursuit workflow history
STATEMENT: CareerOps shall show each pursuit's current stage, current status, and next follow-up date when scheduled. It shall also show a chronological timeline with each event's date, type, recorder when known, and any notes. Stage and status changes shall show the previous and new values.
